   "section": "mod-tome/data/zones/town-gates-of-morning/grids.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "A farportal is a way to travel incredible distances in the blink of an eye. They usually require an external item to use. You have no idea if it is even two-way.\nThis one seems to go near the town of Last Hope in Maj'Eyal.",
   "target": "远行传送门能让人眨眼间跨越难以想象的距离。它们通常需要借助外部物品才能使用。你不知道这道门是否为双向的。\n这座传送门似乎通往马基·埃亚尔最后的希望城附近。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/zones/town-gates-of-morning/grids.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    42
